   Always include a fact for business_name and one for business_description.

   If what they wrote already answers a fact, give "value" (under 8 words) and "quote" — the exact words from what they wrote that say it. Otherwise leave both empty. Never fill a value they did not state.

5. "operating_stage": "operating" or "opening" or "unknown". "engagement_type": "capability" when they came about one specific problem, "full" only when they want the whole operation looked at, or "unknown".

